DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}/profiles/{profile_name}/memories/{memory_id}
Deletes a memory by ID. Removes the memory and any source messages linked to it. Returns the deleted memory.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare Account ID.; namespace_name (path); profile_name (path); memory_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}/profiles/{profile_name}/memories/{memory_id}
Retrieves a memory by ID.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare Account ID.; namespace_name (path); profile_name (path); memory_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}
Deletes a namespace.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare Account ID.; namespace_name (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}
Gets a namespace by name.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare Account ID.; namespace_name (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}/profiles/{profile_name}
Marks a profile for deletion.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare Account ID.; namespace_name (path); profile_name (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/agent-memory/namespaces/{namespace_name}/profiles/{profile_name}/sessions/{session_id}
Marks all memories and messages in a profile that are tagged with the given session ID for deletion.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare Account ID.; namespace_name (path); profile_name (path); session_id (path) — Session identifier.
